aturentyp, wenn Du Volraths Arbeitsraum sprichst.\\n5, {T}: Bringe eine Spielsteinkreatur ins Spiel. Behandle diesen Spielstein wie eine 2/2 Kreatur, die den gewählten Kreaturentyp und die gewählte Farbe hat.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef11bd7a-79b8-493b-811e-1459bc076c7d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Laboratorio de Volrath', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61a19562-5475-4d0e-8351-8f840fb5ccdf'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Laboratoire de Wöhlrajh', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fac347d0-0ce0-417d-9bb7-31d58f4c2762'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Laboratorio di Volrath', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f88c57aa-c1d2-4998-9c6d-a734edd70b3a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'ヴォルラスの研究室', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4ee8da8-08af-4d3b-8a89-b9e1f4ed1ae5'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Laboratório de Volrath', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00564a3f-6b93-46f4-b3e8-7da903466fba'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Volraths Felsenburg', 'text': '{T}: Erhöhe Deinen Manavorrat um ein farbloses Mana.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Lege eine Kreaturenkarte Deiner Wahl aus Deinem Friedhof oben auf Deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Legendäres Land', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c66a85b-b8af-4e00-990a-9372a9a25b8a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Fortaleza de Volrath', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e86e125c-3f57-4354-8f57-8c1f672c64b0'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Forteresse de Wöhlrajh', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '72c6281e-5e64-41e9-ba1a-17bcd1ddf86e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Fortezza di Volrath', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12b6cf8d-7b9d-487a-8800-6c496254ac66'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'ヴォルラスの要塞', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd8bc706-b91c-4679-b3db-770f484d7977'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Fortaleza de Volrath', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f1ffdc0-bbca-4bf3-b7b6-69e7a8a831b3'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Volraths Gestaltwandler', 'text': 'Solange die oberste Karte auf Deinem Friedhof eine Kreaturenkarte ist, ist Volraths Gestaltwandler eine Kopie dieser Kreatur. Zusätzlich behält der Gestaltwandler seine Fähigkeiten.\\n{2}: Wähle eine Karte aus Deiner Hand und wirf diese ab.', 'type': 'Beschwörung eines Gestaltwandlers', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cccdd235-1f87-4e7f-9bbc-fa106845cd8b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Metamorfo de Volrath', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e001612d-a88f-4722-832c-bea53ce44c7c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Changeforme de Wöhlrajh', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d2bb5d8-5eda-4140-b70a-8152c7967d6b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Polimorfo di Volrath', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cdc78e1f-b7e7-43d8-93ec-713df1d70c70'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'ヴォルラスの多相の戦士', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d96776c-8bee-4ae7-8eb5-856cd60d5c48'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Metamorfo de Volrath', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cbff97b9-8f7b-4f6e-b373-c1415e52d77a'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Volraths Gärten', 'text': '2, tappe eine Kreatur, die Du kontrollierst: Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu. Spiele diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46470184-623b-4706-98d9-b9d33acc30b4'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Jardines de Volrath', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c6d70824-aeea-4df2-ae8c-a7303c3c85a5'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Jardins de Wöhlrajh', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '686069c2-77ab-4835-9aef-dbc23fadff32'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Giardini di Volrath', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '999c676d-644b-4ac9-9c08-6501ff92fde7'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'ヴォルラスの庭園', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da374b6e-d476-47bd-abba-42693760b6a7'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Jardins de Volrath', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b04fb5b1-586b-4818-b521-c115d60c3256'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Wandernder Traum', 'text': 'Der wandernde Traum kann nicht geblockt werden.\\nDer wandernde Traum enttappt nicht während Deiner Enttapp-Phase, wenn ein Gegner zwei oder mehr Kreaturen kontrolliert.', 'type': 'Beschwörung einer Illusion', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c2a71f1-4856-478a-8f1a-dcf54dbfaec4'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sueño andante', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c283de66-02b3-4169-93b2-532216d06a9b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Rêve errant', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '939cba3f-4340-4efa-aa27-c7014c16797d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sogno Animato', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '117cecc9-e053-451f-a0b4-f18e097de182'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '歩き回る夢', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f02445df-06eb-4907-9e99-9b27737c0960'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sonho Andarilho', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58fedea8-2b8b-4b3d-b460-2f1eb4c82fb4'}, 