4c-17a9-468f-8795-4dfc41639b26\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Licido Convulsivo\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99af48df-d0f3-4b45-939f-dddd9c94048e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Litique convulsivant\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'753ac8b0-0922-461c-be2a-f8d824a1a87a\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Licide delle Convulsioni\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d859dcc7-a9da-4bdd-9e4b-7afcb3835972\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'けいれんするリシド\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d188d91-012e-4c32-abe7-f33e851af240\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Lícide Convulsivo\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16cb0342-ce89-41c9-8b11-3f1ebdf8ac84\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Zögern', 'text': 'Wenn irgendein Zauberspruch gesprochen wird, neutralisiere diesen Zauberspruch und opfere das Zögern.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c1c2406-1e78-49f6-8a26-d6fc081c1f90'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Titubeo', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8322df9f-8455-4da2-9e92-972995d203b3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Hésitation', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '916bfbd3-64d7-4f66-8457-d74bc555aa04'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Esitazione', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99b6844e-8b1d-4cb1-b8ae-d8f49ec81559'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '躊躇', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dbff20a5-2932-4827-8f02-57c5689816c9'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Hesitacão', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0007b3f-b4c1-4b7e-98a3-50061fa4cf31'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Zügel der Macht', 'text': 'Du und ein Gegner Deiner Wahl enttappen alle Kreaturen, die ihr kontrolliert. Jeder von Euch übernimmt bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über alle Kreaturen, die der andere kontrolliert. Für diese Kreaturen gilt in diesem Zug die Einsatzverzögerung nicht.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a55c0756-5fe0-48d7-ba8c-3af8643faf31'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Riendas del poder', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e7f5a45-bc11-4444-a817-5b3d6071a2a8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Rênes du pouvoir', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '332da637-64bc-4eed-a643-c1d55614489a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Redini del Potere', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '374171e6-d39e-4745-97e2-83a79b918214'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '手綱', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70760b1e-f43a-41f7-ac2d-61bc3951a614'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Rédeas do Poder', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '932b2586-d315-45e6-b8d5-e2ce8b0e4ba4'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Überzeugung', 'text': 'Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+3.\\n{W}: Bringe die Überzeugung auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.', 'type': 'Verzaubere Kreatur', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e541c19-a243-473c-a2b2-ad9d192ed7ca'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Convicción', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8d005514-601d-467e-ba18-58d534834e07'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Conviction', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e8ee355-ff9a-47c0-a493-0f238f46060f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Condanna', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b59f730-a0c1-47b1-8901-8cf36fc0f70f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '罪の自覚', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb8c454b-aca6-4df8-8e3c-cb6fd7656c73'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Conviccão', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b2ef07f-4fc8-422c-aa0e-d5da35d9ae2a'}, 'multiverseid': None}]"]
