original_text: ['(Walls cannot attack.)\\nFirst strike', '(Walls cannot attack.)\\nFor each 1 combat damage dealt to Wall of Essence, gain 1 life.', "(Walls cannot attack.)\\nIf Wall of Tears blocks any creatures, return each of those creatures to owner's hand at end of combat.", '(Walls cannot attack.)\\nWhen Wall of Blossoms comes into play, draw a card.', '(Walls cannot attack.)\\nWhenever Wall of Souls is dealt combat damage, it deals an equal amount of damage to target opponent.', 'All creatures you control can block creatures with flying until end of turn.', 'All creatures you control gain trample.', 'All other black creatures get -1/-1.', "As long as the top card of your graveyard is a creature card, Volrath's Shapeshifter is a copy of that card, except that Volrath's Shapeshifter retains its abilities.\\no2: Choose and discard a card.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, untap all creatures and lands.", "Buyback o2o\\nBo\\nB (You may pay an additional o2o\\nBo\\nB when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nTarget opponent loses 2 life. You gain 2 life.", "Buyback o2o\\nBo\\nB (You may pay an additional o2o\\nBo\\nB when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nTarget player chooses and discards a card.", "Buyback o2o\\nU (You may pay an additional o2o\\nU when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nTap target artifact, creature, or land.", "Buyback o3 (You may pay an additional o3 when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nFanning the Flames deals X damage to target creature or player.", "Buyback o3 (You may pay an additional o3 when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nTarget creature cannot attack this turn.", "Buyback o3 (You may pay an additional o3 when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nTarget creature gets +3/+0 until end of turn.", "Buyback o3 (You may pay an additional o3 when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nTarget land becomes a 2/2 creature permanently. (This creature still counts as a land.)", "Buyback o4 (You may pay an additional o4 when you play this spell. If you do, put it into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nPut a Rat token into play. Treat this token as a 1/1 black creature.", "Buyback—\\nSacrifice a land (You may sacrifice a land in addition to any other costs when you play this spell. If you do, put Constant Mists into your hand instead of your graveyard as part of the spell's effect.)\\nCreatures deal no combat damage this turn.", 'Choose a card in your hand and put it on top of your library: Prevent all damage from an instant or sorcery. (Treat further damage from that source normally.)', 'Choose two target creatures controlled by any one player. Remove one of those creatures from the game and put two +1/+1 counters on the other.', 'Counter target spell unless its caster pays an additional o3.', 'Craven Giant cannot block.', "Creatures do not untap during their controllers' untap phases.\\nWhenever any creature comes into play, untap all creatures.", 'Crovax the Cursed counts as a Vampire.\\nCrovax comes into play with four +1/+1 counters on it.\\nDuring your upkeep, sacrifice a creature and put a +1/+1 counter on Crovax, or remove a +1/+1 counter from Crovax.\\noo\\nB Crovax gains flying until end of turn.', "Destroy all creatures target player controls. For each creature put into any graveyard in this way, put two Goblin tokens into play under that player's control. Treat these tokens as 1/1 red creatures.", 'Destroy all nonbasic lands.', 'Destroy target blocked creature.', 'Destroy target tapped creature.', 'Draw three cards, then choose and discard a card.', 'Dream Prowler is unblockable as long as no other creatures are attacking.', "During each player's upkeep, that player discards a card at random.", 'Each Sliver gains "Pay 2 life: Return this creature to owner\'s hand."', 'Each Sliver gains "o2, Sacrifice this creature: Gain 4 life."', 'Each Sliver gains "o2, Sacrifice this creature: This creature deals 2 damage to target creature or player."', 'Each creature blocks whenever able.\\nAttacking player chooses how each creature blocks. (All blocking assignments must still be legal.)', 'Each creature with power greater than the number of cards in your hand cannot attack.', 'Enchanted creature gains "oc\\nT: Prevent all damage to any creature from any one source." (Treat further damage from that source normally.)', "Enchanted creature gets +1/+3.\\noo\\nW Return Conviction to owner's hand.", 'Enchanted creature gets -3/-0.', 'First strike', 'Flame Wave deals 4 damage to target player and each creature he or she controls.', 'Flowstone Hellion is unaffected by summoning sickness.\\no0: Flowstone Hellion gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nAttacking does not cause Skyshroud Falcon to tap.', 'Flying\\nCloud Spirit can block only creatures with flying.', 'Flying\\nDuring your upkeep, pay o\\nU or sacrifice Spindrift Drake.', 'Flying\\nFor each 1 damage Warrior Angel deals, gain 1 life.', 'Flying\\nRevenant has power and toughness each equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard.', 'Flying\\nWhen Foul Imp comes into play, lose 2 life.', 'Flying\\no0: Redirect 1 damage from Spirit en-Kor to a creature you control.', 'Flying\\no\\nRo\\nRoo\\nR Put Shard Phoenix into your hand. Use this ability only if Shard Phoenix is in your graveyard and only during your upkeep.\\nSacrifice Shard Phoenix: Shard Phoenix deals 2 damage to each creature without flying.', 'Flying\\noo\\nB Dungeon Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\noo\\nU Target spell or ability, which targets only Silver Wyvern, targets another creature of your choice instead. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'Furnace Spirit is unaffected by summoning sickness.\\noo\\nR Furnace Spirit gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Hammerhead Shark cannot attack unless defending player controls any islands.', 'If any Sliver is blocked, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each creature blocking it.', 'If any other creature comes into play, sacrifice Mogg Bombers and it deals 3 damage to target player.', 'If any spell is played, counter that spell and sacrifice Hesitation.', "If enchanted creature attacks, return that creature and Contempt to owner's hand at end of combat.", 'If you control any creature with toughness 2 or less, sacrifice Endangered Armodon.', 'Instead of paying the casting cost for a spell of any color, its caster may choose and discard a card that shares at least one color with that spell. If the spell has o\\nX in its casting cost, X is 0.', "Look at the top five cards of target player's library. Put any number of those cards on the bottom of that library in any order and the rest on top of the library in any order.", 'Mindwarper comes into play with three +1/+1 counters on it.\\no2o\\nB, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Mindwarper: Target player chooses and discards a card. Play this ability as a sorcery.', 'Mob Justice deals 1 damage to target player for each creature you control.', 'Mogg Flunkies cannot attack or block during a turn in which no other creature you control attacks or blocks.', 'Prevent 1 damage to any creature or player.\\nDraw a card.', 'Prevent up to X damage to target creature. For each 1 damage prevented in this way, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature.', 'Put two +1/+1 counters, distributed any way you choose, on any number of target creatures.', "Return all creatures to owners' hands.", 'Reveal the top four cards of your library to all players. Put any of those cards that are lands into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.', 'Sacrifice Morgue Thrull: Put the top three cards of your library into your graveyard.', "Sacrifice a creature: Fling deals damage equal to the sacrificed creature's power to target creature or player.", "Sacrifice a creature: Return any number of target creatures you control to owner's hand.", 'Sacrifice a creature: Search your library for any copy of target creature card and put it into play. Shuffle your library afterwards.', 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\\nIf Soltari Champion attacks, all other creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\\nSacrifice Thalakos Deceiver: Gain control of target creature permanently. Use this ability only if Thalakos Deceiver is attacking and unblocked.', 'Shifting Wall counts as a Wall. (Walls cannot attack.)\\nShifting Wall comes into play with X +1/+1 counters on it.', 'Shock deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', 'Skeleton Scavengers comes into play with one +1/+1 counter on it.\\nPay o1 for each +1/+1 counter on Skeleton Scavengers: Regenerate Skeleton Scavengers and put a +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Skip drawing a card: Put a study counter on Pursuit of Knowledge.\\nRemove three study counters from Pursuit of Knowledge, Sacrifice Pursuit of Knowledge: Draw seven cards.', 'Sliver Queen counts as a Sliver.\\no2: Put a Sliver token into play. Treat this token as a 1/1 colorless creature.', 'Slivers cannot be the target of spells or abilities.', 'Spike Breeder comes into play with three +1/+1 counters on it.\\no2, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Breeder: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\no2, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Breeder: Put a Spike token into play. Treat this token as a 1/1 green creature.', 'Spike Colony comes into play with four +1/+1 counters on it.\\no2, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Colony: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Spike Feeder comes into play with two +1/+1 counters on it.\\no2, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Feeder: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\nRemove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Feeder: Gain 2 life.', 'Spike Soldier comes into play with three +1/+1 counters on it.\\no2, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Soldier: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\nRemove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Soldier: Spike Soldier gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Spike Worker comes into play with two +1/+1 counters on it.\\no2, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Worker: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Spitting Hydra comes into play with four +1/+1 counters on it.\\no1o\\nR, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spitting Hydra: Spitting Hydra deals 1 damage to target creature.', 'Tap up to three target creatures without flying.', 'Target creature gains flying until end of turn.\\nDraw a card.', 'Target spell, which targets only a single player, targets another player of your choice instead.', "The cost of each creature ability requiring an activation cost is reduced by o1. This cannot reduce an ability's generic mana cost to less then o1.", 'Trample\\no0: Redirect 1 damage from Lancers en-Kor to a creature you control.', 'Trample\\no1oo\\nG Regenerate Carnassid.', 'Trample\\noo\\nR Flowstone Mauler gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Untap target creature you do not control. That creature blocks this turn if able.\\nDraw a card.', 'Walking Dream is unblockable.\\nWalking Dream does not untap during your untap phase if any opponent controls two or more creatures.', 'Walls can attack as though they were not Walls.', 'When Mox Diamond comes into play, choose and discard a land card or sacrifice Mox Diamond.\\noc\\nT: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool. Play this ability as a mana source.', 'When Serpent Warrior comes into play, lose 3 life.', 'When Venerable Monk comes into play, gain 2 life.', "When you play Volrath's Laboratory, choose a color and a creature type.\\no5, oc\\nT: Put a token creature into play. Treat this token as a 2/2 creature of the chosen color and creature type.", 'Whenever Lowland Basilisk damages any creature, destroy that creature at end of combat.', 'Whenever Mogg Maniac is dealt damage, it deals an equal amount of damage to target opponent.', 'Whenever an effect controlled by any opponent puts a land into your graveyard from play, put that land into play.', 'Whenever any card is put into your graveyard from play, Jinxed Ring deals 1 damage to you.\\nSacrifice a creature: Target opponent gains control of Jinxed Ring permanently', "Whenever any creature blocks, Heat of Battle deals 1 damage to that creature's controller.", "Whenever any creature comes into play, if there are two or more other creatures in play, set that creature aside. If Portcullis leaves play, put the creature into play under its owner's control.", 'Whenever any creature is put into your graveyard from play, put that creature on top of your library.', 'Whenever any creature you control is put into any graveyard, each other player sacrifices a creature.', 'Whenever any opponent discards a card, Megrim deals 2 damage to him or her.', 'Whenever any opponent plays a land, you may choose a land card from your hand and put it into play.', 'Whenever any player plays a land, that player draws a card.', 'Whenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, it produces an additional o\\nGo\\nG.', 'Whenever you successfully cast a spell, gain 1 life.', 'You and target opponent each untap and gain control of all creatures the other controls until end of turn. Those creatures are unaffected by summoning sickness this turn.', 'o0: Redirect 1 damage from Nomads\\nen-Kor to a creature you control.', 'o0: Redirect 1 damage from Shaman en-Kor to a creature you control.\\no1oo\\nW Redirect to Shaman en-Kor all damage dealt to any one creature from any one source.', 'o0: Redirect 1 damage from Warrior en-Kor to a creature you control.', 'o1, Discard a card at random: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'o1oo\\nR Target creature cannot block Duct Crawler this turn.', 'o2, Tap a creature you control: Gain 2 life. Play this ability as a sorcery.', 'o2, oc\\nT: Bullwhip deals 1 damage to target creature. That creature attacks this turn if able.', 'o3, oc\\nT: Put a Hornet token into play. Treat this token as a 1/1 artifact creature with flying that is unaffected by summoning sickness. At end of turn, destroy the token.', 'o\\nB, Choose and discard a creature card: Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'o\\nB, oc\\nT: Corrupting Licid loses this ability and becomes a creature enchantment that reads "Enchanted creature cannot be blocked except by artifact creatures and black creatures" instead of a creature. Move Corrupting Licid onto target creature. You may pay o\\nB to end this effect.', 'o\\nG, oc\\nT: Reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a basic land card. Put that card into your hand and put all other revealed cards into your graveyard.', 'o\\nG, oc\\nT: Tempting Licid loses ability and becomes a creature enchantment that reads "All creatures able to block enchanted creature do so" instead of a creature. Move Tempting Licid onto target creature. You may pay o\\nG to end this effect.', 'o\\nR, oc\\nT: Convulsing Licid loses this ability and becomes a creature enchantment that reads "Enchanted creature cannot block" instead of a creature. Move Convulsing Licid onto target creature. You may pay o\\nR to end this effect.', 'o\\nU, oc\\nT: Gliding Licid loses this ability and becomes a creature enchantment that reads "Enchanted creature gains flying" instead of a creature. Move Gliding Licid onto target creature. You may pay o\\nU to end this effect.', 'o\\nW, oc\\nT: Calming Licid loses this ability and becomes a creature enchantment that reads "Enchanted creature cannot attack" instead of a creature. Move Calming Licid onto target creature. You may pay o\\nW to end this effect.', 'oc\\nT, Sacrifice a creature: Destroy target nonblack creature.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nG to your mana pool. Play this ability as a mana source.', 'oc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.\\no1o\\nB, oc\\nT: Put target creature card from your graveyard on top of your library.', 'oc\\nT: Target blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'oc\\nT: Target creature gains shadow until end of turn. (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)', 'oc\\nT: Target creature with flying gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'oc\\nT: Target land is an island until end of turn.', 'oc\\nT: Target legend gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'oo\\nR Enchanted creature gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', 'oo\\nR Flowstone Shambler gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', 'oo\\nW Honor Guard gets +0/+1 until end of turn.']
